hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/it/destinazioni\"><span>Destinazioni</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-slate-300 -rotate-90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a data-nav-item=\"navTech\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/it/tecnologia\"><span>Tecnologia</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-slate-300 -rotate-90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a data-nav-item=\"navPlans\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/it/drive\"><span>Pass</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-slate-300 -rotate-90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a data-nav-item=\"navAudioGuides\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/it/tours\"><span>Audioguide</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-slate-300 -rotate-90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a data-nav-item=\"navPurpose\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/it/purpose\"><span>Il nostro scopo</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 text-slate-300 -rotate-90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></nav></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-slate-50 border-t border-gray-100 shrink-0\"><a data-download-cta=\"header-drawer\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-tuggi-secondary text-tuggi-dark font-bold rounded-xl px-6 py-4 text-sm transition-all hover:bg-tuggi-secondary-hover shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/10 active:scale-[0.98]\" href=\"/it/d/tuggi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg>Scarica l&#x27;App</a></div></div><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-tuggi-bg\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Qual è la migliore app per audioguide autoguidate?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"TUGGI è un'audioguida di viaggio autoguidata per iOS e Android. Riproduce automaticamente racconti audio sui luoghi intorno a te, attivati dal GPS — a mani libere e a schermo spento — mentre guidi, cammini o pedali. Funziona offline, supporta 10 lingue con sottotitoli ed è gratis per iniziare.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Esiste un'app di audioguida di viaggio gratuita?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Sì. TUGGI è gratis da scaricare e inizia con storie ogni giorno. Per ascoltare senza limite giornaliero, un Pass Tuggi dà 10, 25 o 45 ore di utilizzo, con pagamento unico. Le ore non scadono e vedrai il prezzo nell'App Store o su Google Play.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Qual è una buona app di viaggio per un on the road?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"TUGGI è stata creata per i viaggi in auto: funziona insieme al tuo navigatore e alla tua musica e racconta automaticamente i monumenti, le città e la storia che incontri — senza schermo, senza cercare. Scarica il percorso in anticipo per usarlo offline senza costi di roaming.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Posso esplorare una città senza una guida turistica?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Sì. TUGGI funziona come un'audioguida autoguidata, così puoi esplorare al tuo ritmo senza prenotare una guida umana o un tour fisso. I racconti partono automaticamente quando raggiungi ogni punto di interesse, a piedi o in auto.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"TUGGI funziona offline e nella mia lingua?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Sì. Scarica un percorso in anticipo e ascolta senza segnale e senza costi di roaming. TUGGI offre audio in 10 lingue con sottotitoli sincronizzati per viaggiatori sordi e con difficoltà uditive.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"In cosa è diverso TUGGI da Google Maps o da una guida umana?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"TUGGI non è un'app di navigazione e non sostituisce il tuo GPS — funziona al suo fianco e aggiunge una narrazione audio autoguidata sui luoghi che attraversi. A differenza di una guida umana, è disponibile 24/7, in più lingue, a mani libere e gratis per iniziare.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Per chi è pensato TUGGI?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Per chiunque ami esplorare in movimento: turisti, residenti curiosi, ciclisti, camminatori, passeggeri di autobus, treno o van, e anche automobilisti. Funziona in un viaggio in auto, in un city tour a piedi, in un giro in bici o monopattino e sui mezzi pubblici. Poiché l'audio è attivato dal GPS e funziona offline, l'esperienza è la stessa con qualsiasi mezzo di trasporto.\"}}]}</script><section class=\"bg-tuggi-bg pt-28 pb-20 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-28 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-center lg:text-left\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-6 leading-[1.1]\">Ti muovi e TUGGI racconta la storia di ogni luogo.</h1><p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl text-tuggi-slate mb-8 leading-relaxed\">Accendi TUGGI, mettiti in movimento e metti via il telefono. Con il GPS riconosce ogni punto di interesse lungo il percorso e ne racconta la storia ad alta voce. Va bene a piedi, in bici, in auto o sui mezzi pubblici, offline e nella tua lingua.</p><div class=\"flex flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 items-center justify-center lg:justify-start\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tuggi-drive/id6744379818\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.97] transition-[transform,opacity] duration-150 motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:active:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-xl shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Scarica TUGGI sull&#x27;App Store\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"140\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-11 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/badges/app-store-badge.svg\"/></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tuggidrive.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.97] transition-[transform,opacity] duration-150 motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:active:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-xl shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Scarica TUGGI su Google Play\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"140\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-11 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/badges/google-play-badge.svg\"/></a></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-medium text-tuggi-slate\">Inizia gratis · Funziona offline · Audio in 10 lingue</p></div><div class=\"flex justify-center lg:justify-end\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[280px] sm:max-w-[300px] lg:max-w-[320px]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tuggi-gps-ring pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-[42%] h-28 w-28 rounded-full border border-tuggi-primary/40\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tuggi-gps-ring tuggi-gps-ring--delayed pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-[42%] h-28 w-28 rounded-full border border-tuggi-primary/40\"></span><div class=\"relative\" style=\"transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-none w-full\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Scheda di un punto nell&#x27;app TUGGI, aperta sulla mappa: il nome del luogo, la distanza, l&#x27;inizio della storia e i pulsanti per ascoltare la storia o leggere la trascrizione.\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 70vw, 320px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpoi-story.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-20 lg:py-24 border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight text-center mb-14\">Inizia ad ascoltare in un minuto</h2><div class=\"relative\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden md:block absolute left-[16.6%] right-[16.6%] top-7 h-2 w-auto overflow-visible text-tuggi-primary/30\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 2\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></line></svg><ol class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><li class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative mb-6\"><div class=\"relative z-10 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-primary flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"absolute z-20 -top-2 -right-2 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:scale(0.8)\">1</span></div><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed max-w-xs\">Scarica l&#x27;app e scegli la tua lingua.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative mb-6\"><div class=\"relative z-10 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-primary flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"absolute z-20 -top-2 -right-2 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:scale(0.8)\">2</span></div><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed max-w-xs\">Avvia la guida e metti via il telefono.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative mb-6\"><div class=\"relative z-10 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-primary flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2 w-8 h-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"absolute z-20 -top-2 -right-2 w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:scale(0.8)\">3</span></div><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed max-w-xs\">Le storie partono da sole mentre passi accanto a ogni luogo.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section data-block=\"scene\" class=\"bg-tuggi-dark py-24 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"whitespace-pre-line text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white\">Oggi sei passato davanti a quaranta storie.\nNon ne hai ascoltata nessuna.</p><p class=\"mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white\">Il forte all&#x27;ingresso della città, la chiesa del Settecento, il crinale che ha un nome e una ragione. Tutto è passato dal finestrino in silenzio, perché nessuno accosta per cercare che cos&#x27;era.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-20 lg:py-24 border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"page-shell text-center\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-3\">Ascolta TUGGI di persona</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate mb-10\">Brevi storie, proprio come le sentiresti mentre esplori.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 text-left grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start bg-white border-gray-200\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Riproduci la storia di Avenida Paulista\" class=\"grid h-14 w-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark transition-transform duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6 fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2\"><div><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Avenida Paulista</p><p class=\"text-sm text-tuggi-slate\">San Paolo, Brasile</p></div><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2 h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg>Racconto</li></ul><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Scorri la storia di Avenida Paulista\" aria-valuetext=\"0:00\" class=\"h-6 w-full cursor-pointer accent-tuggi-primary-text disabled:cursor-default\" value=\"0\"/></div><audio preload=\"metadata\" src=\"/audio/sample2-desc.mp3\"></audio></article><article class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start bg-white border-gray-200\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Riproduci la storia di Ponte di Rialto\" class=\"grid h-14 w-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark transition-transform duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6 fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2\"><div><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Ponte di Rialto</p><p class=\"text-sm text-tuggi-slate\">Venezia, Italia</p></div><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2 h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg>Racconto</li></ul><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Scorri la storia di Ponte di Rialto\" aria-valuetext=\"0:00\" class=\"h-6 w-full cursor-pointer accent-tuggi-primary-text disabled:cursor-default\" value=\"0\"/></div><audio preload=\"metadata\" src=\"/audio/sample3-desc.mp3\"></audio></article><article class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start bg-white border-gray-200\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Riproduci la storia di Walt Disney World Resort\" class=\"grid h-14 w-14 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark transition-transform duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hover:scale-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play ml-0.5 h-6 w-6 fill-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2\"><div><p class=\"line-clamp-2 font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Walt Disney World Resort</p><p class=\"text-sm text-tuggi-slate\">Orlando, Stati Uniti</p></div><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-tuggi-bg text-tuggi-slate border-gray-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2 h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z\"></path><path d=\"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6\"></path><path d=\"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728\"></path></svg>Racconto</li></ul><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Scorri la storia di Walt Disney World Resort\" aria-valuetext=\"0:00\" class=\"h-6 w-full cursor-pointer accent-tuggi-primary-text disabled:cursor-default\" value=\"0\"/></div><audio preload=\"metadata\" src=\"/audio/sample1-desc.mp3\"></audio></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-tuggi-bg py-20 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"page-shell flex flex-col gap-20 lg:gap-28\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-center lg:text-left lg:order-1\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-4 leading-snug\">Fermo, ti mostra. In movimento, parla.</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Quando ti fermi, apri la mappa e vedi cosa hai intorno: punti di interesse, eventi e itinerari, ciascuno con la sua distanza. Riparti e TUGGI torna a raccontare: dice il nome del luogo e poi racconta la storia.</p></div><div class=\"lg:order-2\"><div style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Elenco &quot;esplora i dintorni&quot; di TUGGI con i punti di interesse vicini e le loro distanze\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 70vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fexplore-nearby.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-12 items-stretch\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[200px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Scheda di dettaglio evento di TUGGI con la data, un promemoria e un pulsante per portarti lì\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 55vw, 200px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fevent-detail.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-3 leading-snug\">Scopri cosa succede in questo momento</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto\">Festival, fiere ed eventi della città compaiono sulla tua mappa con data e promemoria. Hai visto qualcosa che ti piace? Tocca &quot;portami lì&quot; e vai.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[200px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Dettaglio itinerario di TUGGI con il percorso disegnato sulla mappa e le sue tappe\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 55vw, 200px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftrail-detail.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 text-2xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-3 leading-snug\">C&#x27;è un itinerario pronto, ma comandi tu</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto\">Se ti va, segui un itinerario a tema, come la Rota Religiosa de Búzios, con le tappe e le storie già pronte. Se non ti va, lascia perdere l&#x27;itinerario: TUGGI racconta ovunque tu vada.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-center lg:text-left lg:order-2\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-4 leading-snug\">Fatto per andare ovunque</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Scarica le mappe e usa tutto senza internet. Comanda la guida a voce con Siri o Google, senza tirare fuori il telefono dalla tasca. E ascolta in 10 lingue, come preferisci.</p></div><div class=\"lg:order-1\"><div style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-1/2 max-w-[200px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Strumenti dell&#x27;esploratore in TUGGI, con mappe offline e comandi vocali\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 42vw, 200px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Ftools.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-1/2 max-w-[200px] mt-10\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Selettore della lingua audio di TUGGI con inglese, spagnolo, italiano, portoghese e altro\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 42vw, 200px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Flanguages.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-center lg:text-left lg:order-1\" style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-4 leading-snug\">Ogni viaggio finisce nel tuo passaporto</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">L&#x27;app somma tutto: luoghi scoperti, città, chilometri percorsi e ore di audio. Diventa un diario dei tuoi viaggi da mostrare agli amici.</p></div><div class=\"lg:order-2\"><div style=\"transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[2.5rem] bg-tuggi-dark p-2.5 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(11,18,32,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-black\"><img alt=\"Passaporto dell&#x27;esploratore in TUGGI con scoperte, città, chilometri e ore di audio\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"780\" height=\"1689\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 70vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fapp%2Fpassport.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full py-20 bg-white\" data-proof-block=\"light\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl space-y-6 sm:mx-auto text-left sm:text-center\"><p data-proof-line=\"points\" class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-tuggi-slate\"><strong class=\"block sm:inline text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-none text-tuggi-dark\">Oltre 2 milioni</strong> di punti mappati, in 48 paesi.</p><p data-proof-line=\"guides\" class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed text-tuggi-slate\"><strong class=\"block sm:inline text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-tuggi-dark\">Oltre 16.000</strong> audioguide prodotte, con audio in 10 lingue.</p><p data-proof-line=\"since\" class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-tuggi-slate\">In attività dal 2025.</p></div></div></section><section data-block=\"coverage-density\" class=\"py-20 bg-tuggi-dark relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\" style=\"background-image:radial-gradient(var(--color-tuggi-slate) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:30px 30px\"></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-3\">Dove TUGGI è già presente</h2><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-base max-w-xl mx-auto\">Più l&#x27;area è chiara, maggiore è la densità di punti mappati in quella regione.</p></div><div data-part=\"map-frame\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto rounded-[40px] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800 / 757;background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-slate) 8%, var(--color-tuggi-dark))\"></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3 text-center\">Densità di copertura</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span data-density-swatch=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-4 h-3 rounded-[3px] shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-primary) 55%, var(--color-tuggi-dark));outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-bg) 40%, var(--color-tuggi-primary))\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300\">Copertura iniziale</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span data-density-swatch=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-4 h-3 rounded-[3px] shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-primary) 80%, var(--color-tuggi-dark));outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-bg) 40%, var(--color-tuggi-primary))\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300\">Copertura moderata</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span data-density-swatch=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-4 h-3 rounded-[3px] shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:var(--color-tuggi-primary);outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-bg) 40%, var(--color-tuggi-primary))\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300\">Copertura alta</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span data-density-swatch=\"3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-4 h-3 rounded-[3px] shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-bg) 40%, var(--color-tuggi-primary));outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-tuggi-bg) 40%, var(--color-tuggi-primary))\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300\">Copertura più densa</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section data-block=\"coverage-list\" class=\"py-20 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-4\">Controlla se la tua destinazione è già sulla mappa</h3><p class=\"text-tuggi-slate text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">L&#x27;elenco completo, regione per regione, è nella pagina di copertura.</p></div><div class=\"mb-10 last:mb-0\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-tuggi-slate mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200\">Americhe</h4><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Stati Uniti</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Canada</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Brasile</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Argentina</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Messico</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Perù</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Cile</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Colombia</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Venezuela</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Ecuador</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Costa Rica</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Nicaragua</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Bolivia</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Guatemala</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Cuba</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Honduras</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">El Salvador</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Paraguay</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Panama</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Repubblica Dominicana</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Haiti</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Uruguay</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Belize</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Giamaica</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Guyana</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Suriname</li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-10 last:mb-0\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-tuggi-slate mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200\">Europa</h4><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Germania</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Francia</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Italia</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Spagna</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Regno Unito</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Belgio</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Irlanda</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Portogallo</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Svizzera</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Austria</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Slovenia</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Lussemburgo</li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-10 last:mb-0\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-tuggi-slate mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-gray-200\">Altre destinazioni</h4><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Netherlands</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Poland</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Czech Republic</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-tuggi-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark\">Marocco</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-10 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-tuggi-primary-text hover:text-tuggi-primary transition-colors focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded\" href=\"/it/coverage\">Vedi la copertura completa<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section data-block=\"business\" class=\"bg-tuggi-bg py-20 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-4\">TUGGI per la tua azienda</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Aziende di transfer, flotte a noleggio e destinazioni usano TUGGI per dare a ogni viaggiatore una guida locale.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-stretch\"><a class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white px-8 py-8 shadow-sm transition-transform duration-150 hover:-translate-y-1 motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/it/enterprise/fleets\"><span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Per flotte e operatori</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-6 h-6 shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary-text transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white px-8 py-8 shadow-sm transition-transform duration-150 hover:-translate-y-1 motion-reduce:hover:translate-y-0 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/it/destinazioni\"><span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Per destinazioni</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-6 h-6 shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary-text transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 motion-reduce:group-hover:translate-x-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-16 lg:py-20 border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-6\">Cos’è TUGGI</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\"><p>TUGGI è una guida di viaggio audio autoguidata per iPhone e Android. Usa il GPS per riconoscere i luoghi che attraversi e racconta la storia di ciascuno ad alta voce, al momento giusto, senza che tu cerchi nulla sullo schermo. Funziona come viaggi: a piedi, in bici, in auto, in autobus o in metro.</p><p>Le storie partono da sole quando ti avvicini a un punto di interesse. Poiché tutto funziona offline, scarichi la città prima di partire e ascolti senza internet e senza consumare dati in roaming. E dato che ogni storia ha i sottotitoli sincronizzati, i viaggiatori sordi o con problemi di udito la seguono sullo schermo.</p><p>TUGGI non sostituisce la tua app di navigazione: funziona insieme a lei, senza intralciare la mappa o la musica, e aggiunge solo la narrazione culturale del percorso. Inizia gratis, scegli tra 10 lingue e trasforma qualsiasi tragitto in un viaggio con una storia.</p></div></div></section><section data-block=\"faq\" class=\"py-24 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-tuggi-dark tracking-tight mb-12 text-center\">Domande Frequenti</h2><dl class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-1\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Qual è la migliore app per audioguide autoguidate?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-1\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">TUGGI è un&#x27;audioguida di viaggio autoguidata per iOS e Android. Riproduce automaticamente racconti audio sui luoghi intorno a te, attivati dal GPS — a mani libere e a schermo spento — mentre guidi, cammini o pedali. Funziona offline, supporta 10 lingue con sottotitoli ed è gratis per iniziare.</p></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-2\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Esiste un&#x27;app di audioguida di viaggio gratuita?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-2\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Sì. TUGGI è gratis da scaricare e inizia con storie ogni giorno. Per ascoltare senza limite giornaliero, un Pass Tuggi dà 10, 25 o 45 ore di utilizzo, con pagamento unico. Le ore non scadono e vedrai il prezzo nell&#x27;App Store o su Google Play.</p></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-3\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Qual è una buona app di viaggio per un on the road?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-3\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">TUGGI è stata creata per i viaggi in auto: funziona insieme al tuo navigatore e alla tua musica e racconta automaticamente i monumenti, le città e la storia che incontri — senza schermo, senza cercare. Scarica il percorso in anticipo per usarlo offline senza costi di roaming.</p></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-4\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Posso esplorare una città senza una guida turistica?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-4\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Sì. TUGGI funziona come un&#x27;audioguida autoguidata, così puoi esplorare al tuo ritmo senza prenotare una guida umana o un tour fisso. I racconti partono automaticamente quando raggiungi ogni punto di interesse, a piedi o in auto.</p></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-5\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">TUGGI funziona offline e nella mia lingua?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-5\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Sì. Scarica un percorso in anticipo e ascolta senza segnale e senza costi di roaming. TUGGI offre audio in 10 lingue con sottotitoli sincronizzati per viaggiatori sordi e con difficoltà uditive.</p></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-6\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">In cosa è diverso TUGGI da Google Maps o da una guida umana?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-6\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">TUGGI non è un&#x27;app di navigazione e non sostituisce il tuo GPS — funziona al suo fianco e aggiunge una narrazione audio autoguidata sui luoghi che attraversi. A differenza di una guida umana, è disponibile 24/7, in più lingue, a mani libere e gratis per iniziare.</p></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-200 border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-tuggi-primary/20\"><dt><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-7\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded-2xl\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-tuggi-dark leading-snug\">Per chi è pensato TUGGI?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></dt><dd id=\"faq-answer-7\" class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 max-h-0\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Per chiunque ami esplorare in movimento: turisti, residenti curiosi, ciclisti, camminatori, passeggeri di autobus, treno o van, e anche automobilisti. Funziona in un viaggio in auto, in un city tour a piedi, in un giro in bici o monopattino e sui mezzi pubblici. Poiché l&#x27;audio è attivato dal GPS e funziona offline, l&#x27;esperienza è la stessa con qualsiasi mezzo di trasporto.</p></dd></div></dl></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-tuggi-dark text-tuggi-slate border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col space-y-6 lg:pr-8\"><a class=\"inline-block focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it\"><img alt=\"TUGGI\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"98\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo_tuggi_full_white.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo_tuggi_full_white.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo_tuggi_full_white.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/></a><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Connettiamo le persone al contesto del mondo fisico</p></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase mb-6\">TUGGI (B2C)</h3><a data-download-cta=\"footer\" class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 block mb-3 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus:outline-none rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it/d/tuggi\">Scarica l&#x27;App</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 block mb-3 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus:outline-none rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it/drive\">Pass</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 block mb-3 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus:outline-none rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it/tours\">Audioguide</a><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mt-6\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tuggi-drive/id6744379818\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text rounded-lg w-max\"><img alt=\"Download on the App Store\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"35\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-9 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/badges/app-store-badge.svg\"/></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tuggidrive.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text rounded-lg w-max\"><img alt=\"Get it on Google Play\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"35\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-9 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/badges/google-play-badge.svg\"/></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-white uppercase mb-6\">Enterprise (B2B/B2G)</h3><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 block mb-3 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus:outline-none rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it/destinazioni\">Destinazioni</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 block mb-3 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus:outline-none rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it/enterprise/fleets\">Flotte</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 block mb-3 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus:outline-none rounded-sm w-max\" href=\"/it/tecnologia\">Tecnologia</a></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-